  cost 13  u32(v)*(u32(n) == 5 ? 528 : u32(n) == 6 ? 260 : 129) >> 6
           K = u32(n) == 5 ? 528 : u32(n) == 6 ? 260 : 129 (one constant per case) depends only on n: compute it once where n is set; 5 per use once K is known (exhaustive)
